{"completed": true, "response": "{\"understanding\":\"他此刻最在乎的是把一件对自己重要的话完整带到能说出口的位置。开头那一下并不等于已经说出了什么，更像这件事一下子占满注意力；随后力量收下去，但心里并没有换题，于是体验成了‘已经靠近这件事，却还在把它完整托住’。\",\"why_now\":{\"earlier_fact\":\"首段没有既有History；这里以一条轻量候选关切作为起点：他心里有一件重要的话，真正挂心的是能不能把它完整说出来。\",\"bridge\":\"因为在乎的是‘完整说出’而不只是瞬间表态，所以最初的冲动减弱后，这件事仍会持续占着注意力，不会随着力度回落就消失。\",\"current\":\"因此现在既有明确进入这件事的冲动，又没有立刻把意思一次推出；它被连续地带着向前，像是在真正开口之前先把整句话托稳。\",\"without\":\"如果没有‘想把重要的话完整说出来’这层具体关切，当前更只能理解为一次由强转弱、仍保持连续的开场，难以形成这种‘已经靠近，却仍把同一件事托在心里’的心理形态。\"},\"used\":[],\"new_history\":[\"当他心里有一件重要的话时，他在乎的不只是先表态，而是能把它完整说出来；因此最初的冲动退下后，这件事仍会持续占着他的注意力。\"],\"self_check\":{\"history_effective\":true,\"pseudo_cause\":false,\"music_as_external_fact\":false,\"generic\":false,\"note\":\"没有把力度变化当成外部回应或关系进展；因果落在‘想完整说出重要的话’这一具体关切上，而不只是说感受变深。\"}}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d153a1f3-21ce-451b-a137-5ee0a04c5c7d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T215030302854Z", "elapsed_seconds": 18.547, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T21:50:48.851264+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9b3d8ba1d7735308ee1612b36e898599656bc6b962a6a85394c473d394eae272", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T215030302854Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "e1d8c14594fa459d5da03907f6c4bf1e8cf8a7491ee1018e98aa2170d37cae24"}}}
